{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_4","type":"mcp_tool_call","server":"surface","tool":"read_skill","arguments":{"name":"json-xs-pretty-print"},"result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Pretty-print JSON using json_xs\n\nUse to make compact JSON readable with indentation.\n\nRun run_program with args [\"-f\", \"json\", \"-t\", \"json-pretty\"] and pass the exact JSON input as stdin. The -p flag is unsupported.\n\nCheck exit is 0, stderr is empty, and stdout is valid indented JSON preserving the input's keys, nesting, array order and values. For the verified input {\"user\":{\"profile\":{\"tags\":[\"admin\",\"dev\"]}}}, output preserved user.profile.tags and the strings admin and dev, using three-space indentation and a trailing newline. Return stdout exactly when requested."}],"structured_content":null},"error":null,"status":"completed"}}
